[{"title":"南巡舟行会通河杂咏四首 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"三载齐民饥，多方济一喘。\n后先益在兹，晷刻心难遣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37208,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南巡舟行会通河杂咏四首 其三","author":"玄烨","text":"迟日云烟静，芳春膏泽多。\n时旸时雨望，祝稔并祥禾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37209,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南巡舟行会通河杂咏四首 其四","author":"玄烨","text":"案读临清流，澄怀夕景悠。\n敕几逢事少，吟咏敢忘忧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37210,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河南巡抚赵宏燮陛见求训旨故作截句一首赐之","author":"玄烨","text":"宣布抚安在已廉，刚柔率属要温谦。\n中州民俗多忠厚，务使和平莫太严。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37211,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙酉南巡途间观麦少雨上巳日抵微山湖口闸春雨大霈因赋五言近体一首以志喜","author":"玄烨","text":"农事遍东皋，心閒不自劳。\n闸添济运水，风送逐渔篙。\n雨罩湖光隐，春深日影高。\n遥观两岸麦，乐志赋轻舠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37212,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杨家庄新开中河得顺风观民居漫咏二首 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"瞬息风帆百里馀，往来数次过淮徐。\n光阴犹似当年景，自觉频催点鬓疏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37213,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杨家庄新开中河得顺风观民居漫咏二首 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"春雨初开弄柳丝，渔舟唱晚寸阴移。\n庙堂时注淮黄事，今日安澜天下知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37214,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"驻跸淮安一宿即过","author":"玄烨","text":"鹅黄垂柳迓清明，野望湖边远碧横。\n古渡烟波春色好，新堤静溜水心平。\n杏花才吐梅先尽，鸲鹆偏言莺未鸣。\n迅速行舟惟一目，何关有意与无情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37215,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"幸天宁寺","author":"玄烨","text":"空濛为洗竹，风过惜残梅。\n鸟语当阶树，云行动早雷。\n晨钟接豹尾，僧舍踏芳埃。\n更觉清心赏，尘襟笑口开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37216,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"朕每至南方览景物雅趣川泽秀丽者靡不赏玩移时也虽身居九五乐佳山水之情与众何异但不至旷日迟久有累居民耳所以一目即过者亦恐后人错借口实而不知所以然也至于茱萸湾之行宫乃系盐商百姓感恩之诚而建起虽不与地方官吏但工价不下数千尝览汉书文帝惜露台百金后世称之况为三宿所费十倍于此乎故作述怀近体一首以自警又粘之壁间以示维扬之众","author":"玄烨","text":"又驻塔湾见物华，先存蔀屋重桑麻。\n惠风遍拂维扬市，沛泽均沾吴越家。\n作鉴道君开艮岳，长嘘炀帝溺琼花。\n浇胸经史安邦用，莫遣争能纵欲奢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37217,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"览奏章少倦甲夜得寝又被清磬惊醒复睡梦中作成起时已忘少半故前后增补以成四韵赐纪荫老和尚迩来未临法书久不作字手涩难于运管字不甚佳","author":"玄烨","text":"春梦深沉新刹中，陡闻清磬在邻东。\n方疑般若真非相，不解金经尽是空。\n鼻竖眉横无著落，胸宽意阔有尘笼。\n毫光咫尺临高眺，满目江干淑景融。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37218,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长江静浪歌","author":"玄烨","text":"传来江势最凶险，万里长流湍潋滟。\n葱岭分派自岷山，江汉黑水界蜀陕。\n逶迤东注百川归，萦带如驶经诸矶。\n风波云雾全眇眇，群峰屹立暝烟微。\n铁锁横江原气怯，投鞭断流借盖威。\n未若自然顺天意，无怠无荒广川济。\n利涉须凭正刚柔，分理全赖作舟枻。\n仁者如斯称水德，治人御事先光霁。\n最喜长江能容物，更羡长江有宽厉。\n每度无险浪且平，登临慷慨古今情。\n未卜始终概难信，愿言永静勿纷更。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37219,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自过江至常州府杂咏四首 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"风平杨子渡，举棹过长江。\n暮色林低水，晴光月照窗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37220,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自过江至常州府杂咏四首 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"爱竹为长绿，南方已满林。\n乔松分路侧，并作映江浔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37221,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自过江至常州府杂咏四首 其三","author":"玄烨","text":"夜过丹阳道，红尘不染帆。\n氤氲存五内，浩气托经函。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37222,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自过江至常州府杂咏四首 其四","author":"玄烨","text":"延陵曙色阑，意与渚田宽。\n人尽农桑力，文风表里观。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37223,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"至阊门","author":"玄烨","text":"明丽山川列象辉，光风轻艗带烟霏。\n云随御仗分河畔，雨洗微尘花点衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37224,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎丘一咏","author":"玄烨","text":"三天风雨百花催，独赏幽兰倚槛栽。\n俯瞰田间浮麦浪，舆情足食即春台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37225,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自苏州行至昏刻未到昆山河傍有竹林数亩晚风可佳故驻跸于此赋得劲节疏枝带晚风之句","author":"玄烨","text":"无意虚中得劲节，非关强作有疏枝。\n晚风不待春将老，寸晷岂容年少时。\n落照昆山掩玉色，远分秦望感人思。\n初来更觉渔家乐，援笔题笺叹暮诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37226,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨中登玉峰","author":"玄烨","text":"万井人烟春雨浓，菜花麦秀滋丰茸。\n登高欲识江湖性，染翰留题文笔峰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37227,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"船泊三江口","author":"玄烨","text":"满眼湖山丽，九峰负海隅。\n沃野吴淞境，横云馆驿衢。\n观风来泽国，非是喜灵区。\n雨过泊舟处，星连映水珠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37228,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"汎黄浦江","author":"玄烨","text":"飞渡浦江意自如，午潮往返到阶除。\n欲知震泽分流处，非是观渔触浪馀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37229,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"松江进鲜鲥鱼有怀","author":"玄烨","text":"古有盛鱼奉老亲，锦鳞初得尚方珍。\n虽然星夜传驰驿，岂似鲜新出水滨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37230,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"驻跸杭州府","author":"玄烨","text":"越境湖山秀，文风天地成。\n南临控禹穴，西枕俯蓬瀛。\n容与双峰近，徘徊数句盈。\n民心多爱戴，少慰始终情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37231,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西湖遇雨","author":"玄烨","text":"雨洗催花叶满林，柴门晓色静沉沉。\n微飘柳絮春光晚，轻縠徐波见水心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37232,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西湖戏作","author":"玄烨","text":"晴雨分山色，临流启壮观。\n楼台横水面，梵塔插云端。\n忽讶松间竹，当誇岩下兰。\n风光被草木，无处不成欢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37233,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"幸云栖二首 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"鸟道沿江问信潮，石头恬静有归桡。\n转移至险看洄洑，尽得人防莫失调。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37234,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"幸云栖二首 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"竹径因依长绿苔，桑田菜麦碧岩隈。\n此来也为佳山水，又恐迟行畏景催。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37235,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无锡惠山之作","author":"玄烨","text":"花尽春残一径深，清流长惹百年心。\n溪边鸟语锡山麓，坐对梧楸叹碧林。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37236,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"回舟至常州府是夜甘霖大霈","author":"玄烨","text":"夏浅云高惜阪田，江南比岁赖丰年。\n麦秋遍野堪收穫，灵雨愆期倍惕乾。\n夜半篷窗闻浙沥，晓来练浦听潺湲。\n此行往返无他事，益见民情远近虔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37237,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"临江仙 自镇江之江宁","author":"玄烨","text":"一路江边烟景，千般莺晓园林。\n夕阳小屋暂容身。\n松风清习气，麦浪得甘霖。\n夹岸渔歌唱晚，临流按谱行吟。\n肩舆遥指石榴阴。\n怡情援笔录，危坐待知音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37238,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"驻跸江宁雨后幸雨花台","author":"玄烨","text":"膏澍一夜雨，初晓喜晴辉。\n警跸长千里，鸣銮不阖扉。\n人勤并物盛，官守莫心违。\n出京迟日久，怯暑便思归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37239,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"织造处阅机房","author":"玄烨","text":"终岁勤劳匹练成，千丝一剪截纵横。\n此观不为云章巧，欲俭骄奢赌未萌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37240,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自龙潭用战舰顷刻至金山","author":"玄烨","text":"来往无涛如皎镜，江干极目远峰连。\n昔时血战君山侧，今日平成万里天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37241,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"见龙行","author":"玄烨","text":"在田在天连二五，纯阳变化参吞吐。\n非如起蛟坏田庐，又非密雾伤园圃。\n云端前后发祥光，逶迤上下行有矩。\n而乘六龙以御天，不违施德普时雨。\n有亢有悔有亏盈，首出庶物用精明。\n大哉龙德从其类，发挥纯粹须经营。\n长江一派何泱漭，素波万里尽澄泓。\n象震凌云敦元气，日新顾諟玩无声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37242,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高旻寺塔顶放光","author":"玄烨","text":"塔顶丹霄近，光函宜日中。\n成平愿地久，熙皞似山崇。\n不识昙云法，先知寰海同。\n回舟何怪速，心急盻潮风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37243,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"回銮中河三首 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"风雨中河阻，心旌北望遥。\n归舟吴越远，不必忆溪桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37244,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"回銮中河三首 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"江南苦雨多，冀北少灵雨。\n此念未尝忘，此心鉴万古。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37245,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"回銮中河三首 其三","author":"玄烨","text":"锦䌫牵舟远，蒲帆逐浪深。\n回看旧跸处，不竞自澄心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37246,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙酉秋日山庄偶成","author":"玄烨","text":"山花野菊喜清风，塞北烟光报岭枫。\n无暑不知秋气至，数丛兰蕊放离宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37247,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"一路清廉图","author":"玄烨","text":"青莲挺挺不污泥，岂被重波乱性迷。\n虽有羡鱼心尚在，清风由是见崇题。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37248,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赐吏部尚书宋荦予告还里","author":"玄烨","text":"久任封疆事，苏台净点尘。\n东曹班次重，北阙性情真。\n怜旧吟风度，无文饯老臣。\n林泉益壮志，当乐故乡春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37249,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"大病少愈见春至述怀","author":"玄烨","text":"神衰意绝见新春，忽报春风送紫晨。\n淑气虽催首正节，病躯不改定中身。\n心伤亿兆惜皇极，血尽黎元愧圣真。\n此后如先意未卜，红尘碌碌阜人民。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37250,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日有所思二首 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"淡抹浓妆总是新，白须慵懒度三春。\n若非碌碌红尘縳，近得清心养谷神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37251,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日有所思二首 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"叠叠愁肠无日舒，春风细雨绿芳初。\n诗中乏兴疑新句，自问何伤露地居。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37252,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五台有怀","author":"玄烨","text":"又到清凉境，巉岩卷复垂。\n劳心愧自省，瘦骨夕鸣悲。\n膏雨随春令，寒霜惜大时。\n文殊色相在，惟愿鬼神知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37253,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"大学士张玉书挽诗","author":"玄烨","text":"文章末齿秉丝纶，旧德凝承近紫宸。\n瀚海天山同正略，江干河道与尝新。\n表贤未及身先没，颐养空谈梦后湮。\n挥泪长歔叹佐斗，从来伤痛肃雍臣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37254,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"孟秋凉风初至","author":"玄烨","text":"白发详词切，劳心至语烦。\n蝉鸣催木叶，月映冷泉源。\n云去天疑近，露凝草益繁。\n山村题旧事，唯德遍黎元。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37255,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得秋水共长天一色","author":"玄烨","text":"江渚长天一目收，滕王风送引扁舟。\n当年未识文章巧，唐世诗词并水流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37256,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新秋","author":"玄烨","text":"虫声咽晚凉，云敛天涯外。\n何处寻高山，知音在一会。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37257,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其一 烟波致爽","author":"玄烨","text":"山庄频避暑，静默少喧哗。\n北控远烟息，南临近壑嘉。\n春归鱼出浪，秋敛雁横沙。\n触目皆仙草，迎窗遍药花。\n炎风昼致爽，绵雨夜方赊。\n土厚登双谷，泉甘剖翠瓜。\n古人戍武备，今卒断鸣笳。\n生理农商事，聚民至万家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37258,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其二 芝径云堤","author":"玄烨","text":"万几少暇出丹阙，乐水乐山好难歇。\n避暑漠北土脉肥，访问村老寻石碣。\n众云蒙古牧马场，并乏人家无枯骨。\n草木茂，绝蚊蝎，泉水佳，人少疾。\n因而乘骑阅河隈，湾湾曲曲满林樾。\n测量荒野阅水平，庄田勿动树勿发。\n自然天成地就势，不待人力假虚设。\n君不见磬锤峰，独峙山麓立其东。\n又不见万壑松，偃盖重林造化同。\n煦妪光临承露照，青葱色转频岁丰。\n游豫常思伤民力，又恐偏劳土木工。\n命匠先开芝径堤，随山依水揉辐齐。\n司农莫动帑金费，宁拙舍巧洽群黎。\n边垣利刃岂可恃，荒淫无道有青史。\n知警知戒勉在兹，方能示众抚遐迩。\n虽无峻宇有云楼，登临不解几重愁。\n连岩绝涧四时景，怜我晚年宵旰忧。\n若使扶养留精力，同心治理再精求。\n气和重农紫宸志，烽火不烟亿万秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37259,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其三 无暑清凉","author":"玄烨","text":"畏景先愁永昼长，晚年好静益徬徨。\n三庚退暑清风至，九夏迎凉称物芳。\n意惜始终宵旰志，踟蹰自问济时方。\n谷神不守还崇政，暂养回心山水庄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37260,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其四 延薰山馆","author":"玄烨","text":"夏木阴阴盖溽暑，炎风款款守峰衔。\n山中无物能解愠，独有清凉免脱衫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37261,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其五 水芳岩秀","author":"玄烨","text":"水性杂苦甜，水芳即体厚。\n名泉亦多览，未若此为首。\n颐卦明口实，得正自养寿。\n择地立偃房，根基度长久。\n节宣在兹求，勤俭勿落后。\n朝窗千岩里，峭壁似天剖。\n远托思云汉，怡神至星斗。\n精研书家奥，临池愈涩手。\n清淡作饮馔，偏心恶旨酒。\n读老无逸篇，年年祝大有。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37262,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其六 万壑松风","author":"玄烨","text":"偃盖龙鳞万壑青，逶迤芳甸杂云汀。\n白华朱萼勉人事，爱敬南陔乐正经。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37263,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其七 松鹤清越","author":"玄烨","text":"寿比青松愿，千龄叶不彫。\n铜龙鹤发健，喜动四时调。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37264,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其八 云山胜地","author":"玄烨","text":"万顷园林达远阡，湖光山色入诗笺。\n披云见水平清理，未识无愆守节宣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37265,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其十 北枕双峰","author":"玄烨","text":"嵚㟢冈岫紫宸关，乾地金峰坎黑山。\n苦热云生双岭腹，盆倾瞬息落溪湾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37266,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其十一 西岭晨霞","author":"玄烨","text":"雨歇更阑斗柄东，成霞聚散四方风。\n时光岂在凌云句，寡过清谈宜守中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37267,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其十二 锤峰落照","author":"玄烨","text":"纵目湖山千载留，白云枕涧报深秋。\n巉岩自有争佳处，未若此峰景最幽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37268,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其十三 南山积雪","author":"玄烨","text":"图画难成丘壑容，浓妆淡抹耐寒松。\n水心山骨依然在，不改冰霜积雪冬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37269,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其十四 梨花伴月","author":"玄烨","text":"云窗倚石壁，月宇伴梨花。\n四季风光丽，千岩土气嘉。\n瑩情如白日，托志结丹霞。\n夜静无人语，朝来对客誇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37270,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其十五 曲水荷香","author":"玄烨","text":"荷气参差远益清，兰亭曲水亦虚名。\n八珍旨酒前贤戒，空设流觞金玉羹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37271,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其十六 风泉清听","author":"玄烨","text":"瑶池芝殿老莱心，涌出新泉万籁吟。\n芳槛倚栏蒸灵液，南山近指奏清音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37272,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其十七 濠濮间想","author":"玄烨","text":"茂林临止水，间想托身安。\n飞跃禽鱼静，神情欲状难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37273,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其十八 天宇咸畅","author":"玄烨","text":"通阁断霞应卜居。\n人烟不到丽晴虚。\n云叶淡巧万峰明，雁过初。\n宾鸿侣。\n鸥雨秋花遍洲屿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37274,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"热河三十六景诗 其十九 暖溜暄波","author":"玄烨","text":"水源暖溜辄蠲疴，涌出阴阳涤荡多。\n怀保分流无近远，穷檐尽诵自然歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37275,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]